WEBVTT

00:25.237 --> 00:29.019
She breaks the quiet, that's my name.

00:31.540 --> 00:37.522
A nervous laugh, a world of shame. It's Aubrey,

00:37.542 --> 00:41.184
just the same as you, but spelled a different

00:41.284 --> 00:43.384
way, it's true.

00:46.306 --> 00:49.367
She doesn't flinch, she doesn't run.

00:52.361 --> 00:55.403
This simple kindness has begun.

00:57.945 --> 01:02.267
I have to tell her, I have to say the reason I was

01:02.367 --> 01:05.089
named this way.

01:06.690 --> 01:10.592
My mother's name is Obri too, it's something

01:10.672 --> 01:13.474
that she thought to do.

01:16.332 --> 01:19.835
It was a joke that just kind of stuck A name I

01:19.855 --> 01:25.100
curse, my rotten luck A label that she put on me

01:25.340 --> 01:29.964
That I was never meant to be But looking at her I

01:30.004 --> 01:40.513
can see A chance to change my history

01:40.573 --> 01:48.024
This is my chance, this is the day I'll be the one

01:48.084 --> 01:55.545
to walk away From Aubrey and Lafayette The name

01:55.605 --> 02:00.826
she used inside my head This is my first act of

02:00.906 --> 02:08.048
defiance My declaration of alliance

02:10.555 --> 02:14.176
It was a joke that just kind of stuck But now I'm

02:14.196 --> 02:18.157
making my own luck I'm shedding skin I've worn

02:18.217 --> 02:23.738
too long A place where I could not belong You can

02:23.798 --> 02:26.438
call me Jordan

02:28.719 --> 02:34.500
Yeah, you can call me Jordan From now on

02:38.843 --> 02:41.566
Call me Jordan

02:44.891 --> 02:49.657
Call me Jordan

